  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparing future teachers: Educating for Democracy and Human Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to improve the quality of teacher education for future teachers in Albania, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Kosovo, Macedonia and Montenegro. Develop and deliver models for citizenship and human rights to support implementation of democrativ education reforms in the Western balkans.</narrative>
